        "en.hubeali": [
          "<span style=\"font-size: small\">A number of our companions, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Khalid, from his father, from Al Qasim Bin Muhammad Al Jowhary, from Hareyz Bin Abdullah,</span> - similar to it."
